I defended my Ph.D. thesis successfully at MIT in Aug 2023. This was a culmination of 6 years of work, and I am grateful to everyone who helped me along the way! You can find a video recording of my defense [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KRHrGnG0qDY here] and a pdf version of the slides I used during my defense [https://vishrantt.github.io/Thesis_Defense_shortened.pdf here]. You can also find a copy of my thesis [https://vishrantt.github.io/tripathi-vishrant-phd-2023-thesis.pdf here].

